From 0bce44fd50a50f1c001d0c988817ce59db4fba85 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bhalchandra Gajare <gajare@codeaurora.org>
Date: Thu, 27 Jun 2019 16:50:33 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] compress: add support for plugins

Currently tinycompress library works with the underlying alsa kernel
interface for compress playback and capture. Change adds new
functionality to optionally able to interface with plugin to perform the
compress playback and capture. Plugins are compiled as .so files and
dynamically loaded if the compress device is not populated under
/dev/snd/ and rather populated under the sound card definition. Also add
snd-utils to invoke the libsndcardparser to parse the virtual compress
nodes.
---
